{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Keeper of the Enchanted Books who enters the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, purge them of monsters with a magic pen, and leap into the well to plunge even deeper into hidden depths bound by forgotten spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1746529149\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a magic pen with found scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine scrolls found in the books to create a magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/Scrolls.gif?t=1746529149\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls and discover powerful combinations and synergies that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a magic gun using powerful spell combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels provide an unique experience every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight ink monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of scrolls and items to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2140310?t=1746529149","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/9c7318e5873b8807337bc70329e28c13a800bf64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746529149","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/49cd49dc9734cee78e713a64726b174b2f160cc4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746529149","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/49cd49dc9734cee78e713a64726b174b2f160cc4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746529149","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a Keeper of the Enchanted Books who enters the world of books. Traverse arcane dungeons, purge them of monsters with a magic pen, and leap into the well to plunge even deeper into hidden depths bound by forgotten spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/Gameplay.gif?t=1746529149\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build a magic pen with found scrolls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine scrolls found in the books to create a magic gun as you descend deeper into the well. Create a single, devastating projectile unleashing immense destruction in a single strike or trigger a chain of projectiles one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/extras/Scrolls.gif?t=1746529149\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play. Improve. Repeat.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run is a unique experience. Unlock new scrolls and discover powerful combinations and synergies that best suit your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create a magic gun using powerful spell combinations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally generated levels provide an unique experience every time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight ink monsters and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of scrolls and items to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy-to-learn combat system</p></li></ul>","developers":["Starrow Castles"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/fab2a38d017fd461d91423a6fdc4e41e28be65f9/header.jpg?t=1746529149","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Wish Me Well","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> with 1024 VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2000 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Starrow Castles"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/1e705f204364b9a7a640bd4b056e97ad1a9e5bcc/ss_1e705f204364b9a7a640bd4b056e97ad1a9e5bcc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746529149","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/1e705f204364b9a7a640bd4b056e97ad1a9e5bcc/ss_1e705f204364b9a7a640bd4b056e97ad1a9e5bcc.600x338.jpg?t=1746529149"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140310/c2e6d19fb55192895c75e28ba0284a57c00acfbc/ss_c2e6d19fb55192895c75e28ba0284a57c00acfbc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746529149","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it